0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (ORDER WAS PRONOUNCED AS UNDER:) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (1. The petitioner is the recorded owner of agricultural land bearing Sy. No.) Tj
0 -14 Td (145/2 of Begur Village, Bengaluru South Taluk, having acquired the same by) Tj
0 -14 Td (registered sale deed dated 08.03.2024. The petitioner applied for mutation on) Tj
0 -14 Td (12.04.2024. Despite the lapse of nearly two years, the application remains) Tj
0 -14 Td (pending without disposal.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (2. It is the contention of the petitioner that repeated representations to the) Tj
0 -14 Td (second respondent and the third respondent have not yielded any response. The) Tj
0 -14 Td (petitioner contends that the inaction violates the timelines prescribed under) Tj
0 -14 Td (the Karnataka Land Revenue Rules, 1966.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (3. Per contra, the learned Additional Government Advocate submits that the) Tj
0 -14 Td (application is under verification and a decision will be taken in due course.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (4. Having heard the learned counsel for the petitioner and the learned) Tj
0 -14 Td (Additional Government Advocate, and on a perusal of the records, this Court is) Tj
0 -14 Td (of the view that the second respondent has failed to discharge the statutory) Tj
0 -14 Td (duty cast upon it. The Karnataka Land Revenue Rules require disposal of) Tj
0 -14 Td (mutation applications within a reasonable period, which has been judicially) Tj
0 -14 Td (construed as not exceeding ninety days from receipt.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (5. In view of the foregoing, the present petition is disposed of with the) Tj
0 -14 Td (following directions.) Tj
0 -14 Td () Tj
0 -14 Td (6. The third respondent is directed to complete field verification of the) Tj
0 -14 Td (petitioner's application within four weeks from the date of this order. The) Tj
0 -14 Td (second respondent is directed to pass a final order on the mutation) Tj
0 -14 Td (application within sixty days from the date of this order. The first) Tj
0 -14 Td (respondent is directed to ensure compliance and file a compliance affidavit) Tj
0 -14 Td (within ninety days from the date of this order.) Tj
